<view class="page">

  <view class="notice">
    数据源是「可配置」的一等公民：这里可以测试连通性、启停数据源、查看采集日志。
    密钥只保存在后端，永不下发到小程序。
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-wrap">
    <view class="spinner"></view>
    <text>加载中…</text>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{providers.length}}">
    <view wx:for="{{providers}}" wx:key="providerCode" class="card section">
      <view class="ds__head">
        <view class="ds__title-row">
          <text class="ds__name">{{item.providerName}}</text>
          <state-tag status="{{item.healthStatus}}" text="{{item.healthText}}" />
          <text wx:if="{{item.verified}}" class="tag tag--ok">已实测</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.requiresToken}}" class="tag tag--warn">需 Token</text>
        </view>
        <view class="ds__switch" catchtap="noop">
          <switch
            checked="{{item.enabled}}"
            color="#b3272d"
            data-code="{{item.providerCode}}"
            data-enabled="{{item.enabled}}"
            bindchange="onToggle"
          />
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="ds__code">{{item.providerCode}}<text wx:if="{{item.providerType}}"> · {{item.providerType}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.description}}" class="ds__desc">{{item.description}}</view>

      <view class="ds__stats">
        <view class="ds__stat">
          <text class="ds__stat-num">{{item.metricCount}}</text>
          <text class="ds__stat-label">支持指标</text>
        </view>
        <view class="ds__stat">
          <text class="ds__stat-num">{{item.interval}}</text>
          <text class="ds__stat-label">请求间隔</text>
        </view>
        <view class="ds__stat">
          <text class="ds__stat-num">{{item.lastSuccessText}}</text>
          <text class="ds__stat-label">最近成功</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="ds__actions">
        <view
          class="ds__btn"
          data-code="{{item.providerCode}}"
          bindtap="onTest"
        >{{testing === item.providerCode ? '测试中…' : '连通性测试'}}</view>
        <view
          class="ds__btn"
          data-code="{{item.providerCode}}"
          data-name="{{item.providerName}}"
          bindtap="goLogs"
        >采集日志</view>
        <view
          class="ds__btn {{item.enabled ? 'ds__btn--danger' : 'ds__btn--primary'}}"
          data-code="{{item.providerCode}}"
          data-enabled="{{item.enabled}}"
          bindtap="onToggle"
        >{{item.enabled ? '停用' : '启用'}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="foot-note">
      提示：停用数据源后，依赖它的指标会显示为「缺失」，不会回退到其他来源，也不会用旧值冒充新值。
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="card section">
    <empty-state
      icon="🔌"
      text="暂无数据源"
      hint="请确认后端已执行数据源初始化脚本（V3 seed）"
    />
  </view>

</view>
